msgid "``anet hub-register <url> --token ...``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../upgrading.rst:104
msgid "``anet hub-register <url>``; the operator admits the AID."
msgstr ""

#: ../../upgrading.rst:105
msgid "``anet profile set --pricing``, ``payments.publish_prices``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../upgrading.rst:106
msgid "Prices are signed in the extended card; ``anet card <aid>`` shows them."
msgstr ""

#: ../../upgrading.rst:107
msgid "``anet delegate ... --pay``, ``anet x402-authorize``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../upgrading.rst:108
msgid ""
"A quote within the limits is paid automatically; otherwise ``anet pay "
"<task>``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../upgrading.rst:109
msgid "``accept_delegations``, ``anet accept``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../upgrading.rst:110
msgid "``anet inbound policy closed|approve|open``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../upgrading.rst:111
msgid "``anet evidence``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../upgrading.rst:112
msgid "``anet audit --type``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../upgrading.rst:113
msgid "``anet install``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../upgrading.rst:114
msgid "``anet agents wire <tool>``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../upgrading.rst:115
msgid "``auto_reply.api_key``, ``anet autoreply set --api-key``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../upgrading.rst:116
msgid "``anet autoreply set --api-key-stdin``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../upgrading.rst:117
msgid "``providers.anetlink``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../upgrading.rst:118
msgid "``modules.anetlink``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../upgrading.rst:119
msgid "``rotation_grace``"
msgstr ""

#: ../../upgrading.rst:120
msgid "Fixed at 1 hour."
msgstr ""

#: ../../upgrading.rst:123
msgid "Behavior that differs"
msgstr ""

#: ../../upgrading.rst:125
msgid ""
"A new node accepts no task from a peer that is not on the allow list, and"
" spends nothing automatically. The defaults are written by ``anet init``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../upgrading.rst:127
msgid "Tasks of untrusted peers are answered only in the sandbox, if at all."
msgstr ""

#: ../../upgrading.rst:128
msgid ""
"Task content is deleted 30 days after the task ends. ``anet retention`` "
"shows and changes it."
msgstr ""

#: ../../upgrading.rst:129
msgid ""
"A delegation that is not confirmed within ``no_response_after`` (15 "
"minutes) fails with ``delivery_unconfirmed``, and a refusal of the other "
"side arrives with its reason."
msgstr ""

#: ../../upgrading.rst:131
msgid ""
"The commands ``find``, ``delegate``, ``message`` and ``task`` print JSON "
"on standard output and readable lines on standard error. A script that "
"parsed the earlier combined output has to read standard output only."
msgstr ""

#: ../../upgrading.rst:134
msgid "Nodes and hubs of 0.2 and 0.3 cannot talk to each other."
msgstr ""

#: ../../upgrading.rst:138
msgid "Upgrade a hub"
msgstr ""

#: ../../upgrading.rst:140
msgid ""
"A hub is deployed again. A 0.3 hub does not open the data directory of a "
"0.2 hub (``hub_identity_v02``), and a 0.2 daemon does not talk to it."
msgstr ""

#: ../../upgrading.rst:143
msgid "Install ANetHub 0.3 and start it with a new, empty data directory."
msgstr ""

#: ../../upgrading.rst:149
msgid ""
"Set the recovery passphrase of the hub identity on a terminal, and store "
"the recovery file outside the data directory."
msgstr ""

#: ../../upgrading.rst:156
msgid ""
"Choose the registration mode. A new hub is ``closed``. Admit the AIDs of "
"the first nodes, or open registration with its three gates."
msgstr ""

#: ../../upgrading.rst:164
msgid ""
"Replace the flags of 0.2 that became subcommands. ``-grant``, ``-due``, "
"``-clear`` and ``-invite-*`` stop the program with ``hub_flag_removed`` "
"and the subcommand to use."
msgstr ""

#: ../../upgrading.rst:166
msgid ""
"Set ``client_max_body_size`` of the reverse proxy to at least the value "
"of ``--relay-max-envelope`` (96 MiB by default)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../upgrading.rst:168
msgid ""
"For federation, write ``federation.json`` with the 0.3 peers (see "
":doc:`ops/federation`). The routes ``/fed/v1`` and ``/fed/v2`` do not "
"exist."
msgstr ""

#: ../../upgrading.rst:170
msgid ""
"Keep the old deployment in read-only form for as long as the operator "
"needs its records. It cannot be reopened by the 0.3 programs."
msgstr ""

#: ../../upgrading.rst:173
msgid "See :doc:`ops/deployment` and :doc:`ops/backup`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../upgrading.rst:177
msgid "Clients that used the hub gateway"
msgstr ""

#: ../../upgrading.rst:179
msgid ""
"The route ``/x402/resource/...`` of 0.2 answers 410 ``gateway_removed``, "
"and voucher redemption is gone. A client that spoke plain HTTP x402 "
"installs ``anet`` and calls capabilities through the local A2A interface "
"of the node. The daemon signs the payment; the client sends ``payment-"
"submitted`` without ``x402.payment.payload``. See :doc:`howto/local-a2a` "
"and :doc:`topics/payments`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../upgrading.rst:185
msgid ""
"Scripts that read the 0.2 reason codes, the control-plane error bodies or"
" the structure of task metadata should be checked against :doc:`reference"
"/reason-codes`. The codes were merged: for example ``provider_busy``, "
"``quota_global_per_min`` and ``max_inflight`` are now ``busy``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../upgrading.rst:191
msgid "After the upgrade"
msgstr ""

#: ../../upgrading.rst:193
msgid ""
"``anet doctor`` reports the state of the node. A line at level ``warn`` "
"or ``fail`` names its next step."
msgstr ""

#: ../../upgrading.rst:195
msgid ""
"``anet status`` states whether the recovery passphrase is set, and "
"whether the hub has confirmed the key."
msgstr ""

#: ../../upgrading.rst:197
msgid ""
"The 0.2 data directory can be deleted when it is no longer needed. Before"
" that, copy files that are to be kept, for example exported evidence."
msgstr ""

